<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/9/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 3 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, prescribe— (a) uniforms and rank markings for any road transport officer; and (b) the authority card and badge to be carried by any road transport officer.”. New section 13a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/9/eng@> .
